    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d998">

                <pb facs="1044" n="1030" xml:id="pg1030"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.51/10–21444: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Briggs</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad Trujillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-24T16:00:00-05:00">October 24, 1944—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:43 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>464. Referring to my telegram 331 July 13, 6 p.m.<anchor n="34" xml:id="d998-f1"
                    /> I have been informed confidentially by the representative of the holders of
                    bonds of the Dominican Republic that the Chase National Bank has agreed to make
                    a loan of $6,000,000 to the Dominican Government at 3½ percent. Inasmuch as a
                    budgetary surplus of $5,000,000 is anticipated for the present fiscal year these
                    two items would be approximately sufficient to provide for the liquidation of
                    the present outstanding balance of the foreign debt.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Briggs</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
